                                                                                                    |
Verdict                                                                                             |
                                                                                                    |
The re-key is safe to ship once the lock is held for the whole run. The migrate step already        |
retries.                                                                                            |
                                                                                                    |
• keep the batch size at 500                                                                        |
• log every skipped session                                                                         |
  • with its id                                                                                     |
                                                                                                    |
  let key = store.read_key()?;                                                                      |
  for batch in sessions.chunks(500) { rekey(batch, &key)?; }                                        |
                                                                                                    |
See the runbook (https://example.com/runbook) and <b>this</b> note.                                 |
